      "enUS": "badge/en-us/Basic",
      "notes": "保留上游示例交互、文案和样式；复杂 count 节点以 count 插槽提供，Avatar 与 IconLock 使用公开 Vue 子路径"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "name": "Overflow",
      "zhCN": "badge/zh-cn/Overflow",
      "enUS": "badge/en-us/Overflow",
      "notes": "保留上游 count 与 overflowCount 组合及四种数值边界"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "name": "Position",
      "zhCN": "badge/zh-cn/Position",
      "enUS": "badge/en-us/Position",
      "notes": "保留上游四个 position 值与 VIP 文案；RTL 下缺省位置由 Provider 方向决定"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "name": "Theme",
      "zhCN": "badge/zh-cn/Theme",
      "enUS": "badge/en-us/Theme",
      "notes": "保留三种 theme 与 dot 组合；上游 flex 布局的换行行为按同一单行渲染"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "name": "Type",
      "zhCN": "badge/zh-cn/Type",
      "enUS": "badge/en-us/Type",
      "notes": "保留六种 type 与 dot 组合"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "name": "Standalone",
      "zhCN": "badge/zh-cn/Standalone",
      "enUS": "badge/en-us/Standalone",
      "notes": "保留上游独立使用示例；状态标签逐字沿用固定上游文案（中文页含双语标签，英文页为小写标签）"
    }
  ],
